Note: the ONNX model files in models/ are third-party works with their own
licenses. models/README.md lists each one with its source and terms.

Summary for anyone redistributing facetrack:

  Shippable (permissive)  YuNet (MIT), CenterFace (MIT), FER+ (MIT),
                          PP-HumanSeg (Apache-2.0), MODNet (Apache-2.0)

  NOT shippable           RVM (GPL-3.0). Distributing it would put this
                          entire product under GPL-3.0 with a source
                          requirement, so it is excluded from packaged
                          builds (facetrack/edition.py) and remains
                          available for in-house use only.

  Removed                 SCRFD. InsightFace licenses its trained models
                          for non-commercial research only.

The NDI runtime is redistributed under NewTek/Vizrt's NDI SDK terms;
review them before shipping a commercial build.

This license covers only the code in this repository.
